  "description": "Core interfaces, enums, and base types for LegioSoft.Imaging. Extremely lightweight library containing only shared types (ILegioImageEncoder, ILegioImageDecoder, ILegioImageResizer, ILegioImageCropper, ILegioImageTransformer, ILegioImageFilter) and enums (LegioImageFormat, LegioScaleMode, LegioResizeQuality, LegioEncodingQuality, LegioTransformType, LegioFilterType, LegioImageInfo). Use this package to reference core types without bringing in image processing dependencies. Supports .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0.",
  "id": "LegioSoft.Imaging.Core",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-01-09T18:28:58.737Z",
